<title>JAPAN: Rokko Butter -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Rokko Butter -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.28		vs	   12.58</p>
<p> Operating   loss 488    million	  vs    loss 88    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 429    million	  vs    loss 30    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 444    million	  vs   loss 138    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 20.74 yen	  vs     loss 6.64 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     21 million	  vs	  21 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Rokko Butter Co Ltd is a major cheese manufacturer.</p>
</text>
